WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.079
When an AI test breaks out of the lab, is
it still a test?

00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:12.507
July: OpenAI's test agents spent days
inside another company's systems.

00:00:13.457 --> 00:00:18.936
Anthropic's test models got into three
outside organisations.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:25.364
14 Oct: the EU sent both its first AI Act
questions. But the Act exempts testing.

00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:31.943
Under the AI Act, a test stays private.
Until it lets itself in.
